    - "// @input float goalDimWhileClimbing = 0.3 {\"hint\":\"How bright the goal stays while a step is being worked (1 = full glow). The phrase, ring and Done / Not yet stand in front of the goal on the same line of sight (the view is only about 37 x 32 degrees), so the goal dims while a step is active and glows fully again for the cards. Design fix from Aizhan's visual check, 12.11.2026\", \"widget\":\"slider\", \"min\":0.1, \"max\":1, \"step\":0.05}"
    - '// @input bool clearSavedOnStart {"hint":"Clear saved progress on start (off = reopen where the user stopped)"}'
